[3.074765, "o", "ection: database\u001b[K\r\nSource: postgresql-common (274.pgdg22.04+1)\u001b[K\r\nMaintainer: Debian PostgreSQL Maintainers <team+postgresql@tracker.debian.org>\u001b[K\r\nInstalled-Size: 80.9 kB\u001b[K\r\nProvides: postgresql-contrib (= 17)\u001b[K\r\nDepends: postgresql-17, debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0\u001b[K\r\nSuggests: postgresql-doc\u001b[K\r\nDownload-Size: 72.2 kB\u001b[K\r\nAPT-Manual-Installed: yes\u001b[K\r\nAPT-Sources: https://apt.postgresql.org/pub/repos/apt jammy-pgdg/main amd64 Packages\u001b[K\r\nDescription: object-relational SQL database (supported version)\u001b[K\r\n This metapackage always depends on the currently supported PostgreSQL\u001b[K\r\n database server version. It also offers to automatically upgrade the\u001b[K\r\n \"main\" database cluster to the lastest supported major version.\u001b[K\r\n .\u001b[K\r\n PostgreSQL is a fully featured object-relational database management\u001b[K\r\n system.  It supports a large part of the SQL standard and is designed\u001b[K\r\n to be extensible by users in many aspects.  Some of the features are:\u001b[K\r\n ACID transactions, foreign keys, views, sequences, subqueries,\u001b[K\r\n triggers, user-defined types and functions, outer joins, multiversion\u001b[K\r\n concurrency control.  Graphical user interfaces and bindings for many\u001b[K\r\n programming languages are available as well.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[33m\r\nN: \u001b[39mThere is 1 additional record. Please use the '-a' switch to see it\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\r\nDAS\u001b(B\u001b[m on \u001b[35m\u001b[1m alpha/1.1.0\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32m\u001b[1m❯\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32mwhich\u001b[39m psql            \u001b[189X\u001b[38;2;80;200;120m\u001b[189C  /tmp/tmux-1000/default,7127,42\u001b[39m \u001b[K\r\n/usr/bin/psql\u001b[K\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\r\nDAS\u001b(B\u001b[m on \u001b[35m\u001b[1m alpha/1.1.0\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[32m\u001b[1m❯\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[211X\u001b[38;2;80;200;120m\u001b[211C  /tmp/tmux-1000/default,7127,42\u001b[39m \u001b[K\u001b[30m\u001b[43m\r\nswitched session                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[65;24H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?25l\u001b[?1006l\u001b[?1000l\u001b[?1002l\u001b[?1003l\u001b[?2004l\u001b[1;1H\u001b[1;66r"]
